88b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"077b6c57af048c3b","term":"쪽","zh":"边","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3","entryId":"58147","definition":"进行或朝向的方向。","pronunciation":["쪽"]},{"id":"cf17ce5604310bf9","term":"살짝","zh":"稍微","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3","entryId":"61612","definition":"不严重地，略微。","pronunciation":["살짝"]},{"id":"42468453660258f4","term":"찌그러지다","zh":"瘪，压瘪，压缩","audio":"/audio/42468453660258f43c78.mp3","entryId":"78971","definition":"使劲按压，导致表面产生不均匀的褶皱，塌陷下去。","pronunciation":["찌그러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/40a0e754dfe85b14c7ae.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31737-1-8-2","ko":"네, 가벼운 접촉 사고가 있었거든요.","zh":"是的，刚才发生了一点轻微的刮擦事故。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"가벼운","meaning":"轻，轻微","explanation":"가볍다：轻，轻微；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가볍다","audio":"/audio/77632f6eee12aa1b1736.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26788","senseId":"11","lemma":"가볍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가벼운","audio":"/audio/afd244a33dff45e58232.mp3"}},{"text":"접촉","meaning":"接触","explanation":"접촉：接触","readings":[{"term":"접촉","audio":"/audio/f2e6140a46966fbf8b71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31737","senseId":"1","lemma":"접촉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"접촉","audio":"/audio/f2e6140a46966fbf8b71.mp3"}},{"text":"사고가","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고가","audio":"/audio/ba0733d3ab65ceb9dbe1.mp3"}},{